  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b5846f9f-e6ab-4c18-b964-b69aecb86448.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>感謝我們的贊助商</strong></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 ZAP-HOSTING！使用優惠碼 Reggarf-1047 可享全單 20% 折扣！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Create: Waystones Recipes 是一個簡單的模組，它修改了 Waystones 模組的合成配方</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-waystones-texture-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">專為搭配 Create Waystones 材質 + GUI 資源包而設計</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-waystones-texture-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1086710/description_57fa4cfc-fc14-45bf-9ed1-c56cda80a8cf.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"370\" height=\"196\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/create-lets-create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create:letsCreate 模組包&nbsp;</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">本模組使用 Create 模組的合成方式，將所有 Waystones 配方改為 Create 風格的合成配方</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">範例：&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e7191563-59fa-4052-8e74-4a2626c6a762.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"370\" height=\"230\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bd08debd-fa26-4644-97cf-9e9955811cb2.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c062e1b3-8fe5-4735-80d9-1b3cb1e676f5.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7e155262-1388-48b0-9ed7-ae82c6d14fef.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3af587f3-1188-412d-b99a-bfbf66532371.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"370\" height=\"230\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">本模組修改 Waystones 的合成配方，使其與 Create 模組相容並採用其合成系統</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">同時也進行了更好的平衡性調整</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>亦於 Modrinth 平台上架</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-waystones-texture-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create&nbsp;</a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-waystones-texture-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones </a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-waystones-texture-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">材質 </a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-waystones-texture-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI</a>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>我們的其他專案</strong>&nbsp;：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1108525/description_513fe05e-bf03-4ab4-96aa-48b5210314c0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></p><p>Create: Better Motors：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-motors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-motors</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
